INSERT INTO sets (id,session_id,exercise_id,notes,logged_at) VALUES ('s11286','sb11281','wide-up-rail','landed: Yes · confidence: High · With this and all above, very surprised by how natural it all felt. Expected to be coming back farther behind but this was all super smooth!','2025-10-30');
INSERT INTO sets (id,session_id,exercise_id,notes,logged_at) VALUES ('s11287','sb11281','fs-board-slide-rainbow-box','landed: Yes · confidence: Medium · Honestly? First time ever landing this. And it felt great. Cued myself to get low from the knees and it immediately clicked. Just a matter of confidence and reps. Otherwise I think I have the technique and ability. WOW I really didn''t think I''d be progressing almost immediately after being released to return to sport. Can''t complain in the slightest.','2025-10-30');
